Subject: [PATCH] Suitability model: add city-resampling range, within-city
 ranking score and dry-run

- bootstrap_gain: 95% range for the model's AUC gain over the best baseline when cities are
  resampled, so a small gain on few cities is not reported as a win
- mean_within_city_auc: how well crops are ordered inside each city
- --dry-run prints the test results without saving the model, report or scores
- verdict now uses the range

